<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13614" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόρρησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπερῶ</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>forbidding, prohibition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				258c
			</span></i>; <i>interdiction</i>of judgement, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ τὴν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					33.31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκη τῆς ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					2.29
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπείρηκα</span>) <i>givingup,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				357a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μαρτυρίας</span>
			<i>refusal</i>to give  testimony, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				5
			</span></i>; <i>renunciation of a truce,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				14.2.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>disowning</i> of a son, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκήρυξις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>giving in, flagging,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σιν ποιήσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					1.374J.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
